---
requires:
  - book
format: JSON
description: Segment a book of the Bible into pericopes, returned as a strict JSON schema.
---
user: |
  Segment the book of {{book}} into distinct pericopes (narrative or discourse units).

  For each pericope, identify:
  - A descriptive title
  - The passage reference
  - The starting and ending verse references
  - The main theme
  - The type (narrative, teaching, confrontation, etc.)

  Provide a brief rationale for your segmentation approach.

  Focus on natural breaks in the narrative or discourse flow.
